		<title>Installing Erlang 17 for Elixir 0.13 the easy way (Mac)</title>
		<link>http://cromwellhaus.com/2014/04/installing-erlang-17-for-elixir-0-13-the-easy-way/</link>
		<comments>http://cromwellhaus.com/2014/04/installing-erlang-17-for-elixir-0-13-the-easy-way/#comments</comments>
